			\label{app:cor:opt_complete_M}
			Substituting~\eqref{eqs:pq_opt_M} and~\eqref{eq:p_q_s} in~\eqref{eq:H_comp}, the equations $\frac{\partial H}{\partial s_p}=0$ and $\frac{\partial H}{\partial s_q}=0$ yield
			\begin{equation*}
