We evaluate the effectiveness of SDAC through a simulation-based environment and compare it with multiple state-of-the-art methods to showcase its ability to maintain a higher long-term acceptance rate.
% Contributions
The contribution of this work is threefold:
\begin{itemize}
    % % \item Architecture.
    % \item (General framework RL AC MDP inter-SFC (long term performance)) Introducing a novel and dynamic SFC partitioning optimization framework for multi-domain infrastructures.
    % % \item Transformers + Attention Mechanism.
