\section{Related Work}
\label{sec:related}
% Intro Transition
The transition of networking from hardware-oriented network architectures to flexible, software-driven paradigms has made service partitioning and related domains such as SFC, Forwarding Graphs (FG), and Virtual Network Embedding (VNE) key points of system performance and reliability \cite{BHAMARE2016138}.
The increasing complexity of multi-domain network \cite{8423711}, pushed recent literature efforts to integrate learning-based optimization algorithms into service partitioning strategies.

\subsection{Optimization-based Approaches}
Initially, researchers leaned on classical optimization-based algorithmic and heuristic approaches for SFC optimization, based on multiple criteria. % \cite{}.
