Some notable examples related to our work include the following:

In \cite{8494813}, Quang et al., formulate the multi-domain VNF-FG embedding problem as an Integer Linear Programming (ILP) and utilize a heuristic algorithm for dynamic re-allocation.
Authors in \cite{SAHHAF2015492} study optimal network service decomposition and propose two algorithms, an ILP-based to minimize the cost of the mapping, and a heuristic algorithm to solve the scalability issues of the ILP formulation, jointly studying the optimization of decomposition and embedding.
