\Chart{0.40}{Database}\hspace{5mm}
\Chart{0.35}{Data}\\
HyperGraphDB~\cite{iordanov2010hypergraphdb} is as an open-source 
general purpose data storage mechanism.
It is used to store hypergraphs (a graph generalization where an edge can 
join any number of vertices). 
The low-level storage is based on \texttt{Ber\-ke\-ley\-DB} and is 
implemented in \langJava. 
Despite the description on the website mentioning distribution, the 
support for either distributed sharding or distributed replication is not 
