ObjectivityDB~\cite{objectivitydb} is a database 
technology powering the massively scalable graph software platform 
\texttt{Thing\-Span} (formerly known as \texttt{In\-fi\-ni\-te\-Gra\-ph}).  
It is a fully-distributed database (able to scale horizontally) offering 
APIs in \texttt{C++}, \texttt{C\#}, \langJava\ and \langPython.
\dbObjectivityDB\ is described as a distributed 
object database, supporting many data models (among which highly complex 
