\paragraph{Implementation Details} The model's performance was evaluated using two metrics: exact matching accuracy and the BLEU score for n-gram matching. We used greedy decoding in all experiments. We trained the model with hidden dimension size 256 and max length 104. % 모델 hidden size와 embedding size, 그리고 max length 써주시겠어요?
The baseline model is a vanilla transformer network used in the previous work that does not leverage truth tables.


