We curated a set of downstream software projects on GitHub that employ PTMs. To investigate the challenges associated with PTM reuse, we systematically extracted issue reports from these repositories. \rev{In total, we collected 8,373 issue reports across 31 repositories. Through manual annotation, we identified 840 issue reports} related to PTM reuse and thematically analyzed these issues to understand the challenges. Beside constructing a taxonomy of challenges, we also analyzed and compared the resolution times of PTM and non-PTM issues. In addition, we compared and discussed our results with existing relevant taxonomies and related work. 

