As summarized in Table \ref{table1}, our experimental results demonstrate that the KELPS translator maintains robust performance across all evaluation metrics and datasets. Notably, while other models exhibit significant accuracy gaps between Lean and Isabelle formalizations, the KELPS translator's consistent performance confirms its capability for cross-formal-language translation. 

