 . Putting these together, 
 %   
$u_1u_2\subseteq y_1y_1,\, u_1u_1u'\subseteq y_1y_1v' \vdash u_1u_2u'\subseteq y_1y_1v'$  by \cref{substLHS}. 
%
Hence $u_1u_2u'\subseteq y_1y_1v'\dashv\vdash u_1u'\subseteq y_1v',\Gamma$. 
