\subsection{Reasoning Loop}
The agent operates in an iterative scheduling loop:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Observe the current system state (available resources, waiting and running jobs).
    \item Construct a prompt with system state, job queue, and the cumulative scratchpad (decision history and feedback).
    \item Query the LLM with the prompt and parse its response.
