    shear lattice. If ${\bf q}= ({\bf q}_x, {\bf q}_y) \in H_{n,{\bf p}+\Lambda}$ is such that
    \[
        {\bf q}_y < \min\left\{\frac{n{\bf q}_x}{{\bf q}_x^2 - 1}, \frac{n}{{\bf q}_x} + 1\right\},
    \]
    then ${\bf q}$ is a vertex of $\conv{H_{n, {\bf p}+\Gamma}}$.
\end{lemma}
